:\"01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership\",\"title\":\"Story 1: Project Artifact Association Without Process Ownership\"},\"artifactsRead\":[\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-index.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-project-and-process-shell.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-process-work-surface.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-tech-design.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-code-map.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-client.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/test-plan.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/coverage.md\",\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/schemas.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/projects/artifact-section.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/summary/artifact-summary.builder.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/readers/materials-section.reader.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-work-surface.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/review-workspace.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"convex/processes.ts\",\"convex/processes.test.ts\",\"convex/artifacts.ts\",\"convex/artifacts.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/project-shell-bootstrap-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/artifact-section.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/project-shell-page.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Initial verification of Story 1 focused on the in-scope read-model alignment: project-shell artifact summaries, process current-material projection, referenced-artifact reviewability, and the story’s mapped tests/gates across Convex, server, and client surfaces.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[],\"openFindings\":[],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-1.1\",\"TC-1.1a\",\"TC-1.1b\",\"AC-1.2\",\"TC-1.2a\",\"TC-1.2b\",\"AC-1.3\",\"TC-1.3a\",\"TC-1.3b\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"No production-path mocks, shims, or fake adapters were introduced in the reviewed Story 1 surfaces. The only fakes observed were test-only harnesses such as `InMemoryPlatformStore` and fake Convex contexts under `tests/` and `convex/*.test.ts`.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"pass\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"Story 1’s read paths are aligned to project-scoped artifact summaries and process-local current refs: `artifactSummarySchema` now exposes only `artifactId`, `displayName`, `currentVersionLabel`, and `updatedAt`, the project-shell UI no longer renders ownership copy, `setCurrentProcessMaterialRefs` updates per-process current refs after same-project validation, `MaterialsSectionReader` filters artifacts by those refs, and `DefaultArtifactReviewService` allows review when the process currently references the artifact while preserving earlier-version provenance via `producedByProcessId`.\",\"Legacy ownership residue still exists in the out-of-scope durable write path: `convex/artifacts.ts` keeps `artifacts.processId` in the table shape and still patches it during checkpoint writes. I did not treat that as a Story 1 failure because the story explicitly scopes revision/write-path realignment to later work, and none of the reviewed Story 1 read paths rely on that field anymore.\",\"Repo validation remains consistent with the onboarding baseline: `guard:no-test-changes` is a scaffolded skip inside `green-verify`, and `test:e2e` is still a scaffolded skip inside `verify-all`.\"]},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/01-project-artifact-association-without-process-ownership/006-verify.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T22:01:32.568Z\",\"finishedAt\":\"2026-04-26T22:12:51.874Z\"}\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-009.md:670:    reviewScopeSummary: \"Reviewed Story 4's provenance persistence, environment recording hooks, Fastify read route, shared contracts, and process work-surface rendering against AC-4.1 through AC-4.4 and the story/epic gates. The AGENTS.md onboarding baseline paths under docs/onboarding were not present in this checkout, so verification used the story, tech design, test plan, implementor artifact, and touched code/tests directly.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-009.md:736:      - \"AGENTS.md references `docs/onboarding/current-state-index.md` and companion current-state docs, but those files are absent in this checkout.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/artifacts/04-provenance-and-canonical-source-visibility/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-009.md:767:      {\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"I’m tracing the provenance flow first so we can fix the failed-read behavior 