pose\\\\n8:- test Fastify routes and websocket entry points at the server boundary\\\\n9:- test client pages, router, store reconciliation, and section modules at their\\\\n19:## Verification Tiers\\\\n29:## Test Layers\\\\n31:### Convex Function Service Mocks\\\\n37:### Server Service Mocks\\\\n43:### Client Service Mocks\\\\n45:Route/page/store/section tests with mocked browser API and live transport\\\\n50:### Wide Integration Tests\\\\n56:### E2E\\\\n62:## Mock Boundaries\\\\n66:| WorkOS SDK and session validation | Yes | External auth boundary |\\\\n67:| Convex store adapter in Fastify route tests | Yes | External durable-state boundary for server service mocks |\\\\n68:| Browser `fetch` and live transport wrapper | Yes | API and websocket boundary for client modules |\\\\n69:| Fastify routes / services / readers / builders / projectors | No | These are the server behavior under test |\\\\n70:| Client router / store / page modules / section renderers | No | These are the client behavior under test |\\\\n73:## Fixture Strategy\\\\n75:### Shared Fixtures\\\\n116:### Test Utilities\\\\n120:- extend existing Fastify builder with websocket plugin and process routes\\\\n121:- allow mocked process services and Convex store behavior\\\\n125:- extend existing client render helper to mount process-surface page with store,\\\\n126:  router, mocked HTTP API, and mocked live transport\\\\n128:## Test File Inventory\\\\n135:| `tests/service/server/process-html-routes.test.ts` | Service | authenticated process-route shell delivery and unavailable routing | 4 |\\\\n139:| `tests/service/client/process-router.test.ts` | Service | process route parse/open/reload behavior | 4 |\\\\n146:| `tests/service/client/process-live-store.test.ts` | Service | snapshot/upsert/complete reconciliation | 13 |\\\\n148:| `tests/integration/process-work-surface.test.ts` | Integration | assembled process route, reload, response persistence, reconnect path | 4 |\\\\n154:## TC → Test Mapping\\\\n156:#