-source-management/tech-design.md:226:| Client source sections | Modified/New | Render management controls, freshness, provenance, detach, degraded states | Shared contracts | AC-1.2, AC-2.x, AC-3.x, AC-4.x, AC-5.x, AC-6.x |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-227-\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-228-## Data Model\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-229-\n--\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-297-  repositoryUrl: v.string(),\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-298-  targetRef: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-299-  eventId: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md:300:  entryStatus: v.union(v.literal('ready'), v.literal('degraded')),\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-301-  degradationReason: v.union(v.string(), v.null()),\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-302-  recordedAt: v.string(),\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-303-};\n--\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-311-| `by_sourceAttachmentId_recordedAt` | `sourceAttachmentId`, `recordedAt` | Source history and detach checks |\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-312-\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-313-Provenance copies immutable identity because `sourceAttachmentId` may become