rites, and which ref it targets.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md:13:- **Mental Model:** \"Purpose, access mode, and target ref are durable properties of the attached source, not transient hints for one run.\"\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md-14-- **Key Constraint:** Metadata management must not redefine source identity or artifact ownership.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md-15-\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md-16-**Objective**\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md-17-\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md:18:Make source purpose, access mode, and target ref visible and mutable for existing source attachments.\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md-19-\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md-20-**Scope**\n--\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md-22-In:\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md-23-\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/stories/02-manage-purpose-access-mode-and-target-ref.md:24:- Purpose, access mode, and target ref display in